#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:5 83d8f386cc304725b728b9dcb0f8a138
msgid "Fake GPS"
msgstr "模拟 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:12 645361f73c7f48cca8113d89d05de408
msgid ""
"This allows MAVProxy to substitute a fakegps signal into the autopilot or "
"simulation. This provides an easy means to simulate a given location and/or "
"altitude to the autopilot/sim for testing features like terrain altitude, "
"etc. while still on the bench."
msgstr "该模块允许 MAVProxy 向飞控或仿真器注入模拟 GPS 信号，从而在台架上轻松模拟特定位置和/或高度，用于测试地形高度等功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:14 1b7c3c461a5d45ef9d6d105bc9dd3d4a
msgid ""
"In order to use it after the module is loaded, you must change "
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` to \"14\" (MAVLink) so that GPS data is supplied"
" via MAVLink commands."
msgstr ""
"模块加载后，需将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` 更改为 「14」（MAVLink），以便通过 MAVLink 命令提供 GPS"
" 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:16 35ab6a90cd5f4ea686973f4ac70d1505
msgid ""
"Autopilots with less than 2MB of flash do not have the MAVLink type GPS "
"backend compiled in by default. Use the custom build server to create a "
"firmware that does in order to use this module."
msgstr "闪存小于 2MB 的飞控默认不编译 MAVLink 类型 GPS 后端。如需使用该模块，请使用自定义构建服务器生成包含该后端的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:18 52708afffbe04d51acb71b8a7ea1bd2b
msgid ""
"Then you can right click on any location and see the dropdown options for "
"setting the new location and altitude:"
msgstr "然后可在地图上右键点击任意位置，查看设置新位置和高度的下拉选项："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:23 6a202ebfe9e14813985ffd41714cd163
msgid ""
"resulting it the location moving (there will be a 10 second delay while EKF "
"re-aligns):"
msgstr "位置移动后的效果（EKF 重新对准期间会有约 10 秒延迟）："
